					"nextDialogs": [
						30060906
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30060906,
					"content": "也就是说是管用的对吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30060907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30060907,
					"content": "好，接下来再去战斗一次吧，像刚才那样用平常心就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "艾尔海森"
				},
				{
					"id": 30060905,
					"content": "罐装知识里的东西成为了记忆。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30060906
